      "content": "Comments"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "In JavaScript, you can use the // symbol to create comments. For example:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Example"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "javascript",
      "content": "1// Display Hello\n2console.log(\"Hello\");"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Here, // Display Hello is a comment. JavaScript completely ignores this line while running the program."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Thus, the above program is equivalent to:"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "javascript",
      "content": "1console.log(\"Hello\");"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "content": "How does it work?"
